<title>DUBAI: Sister of Saudi Arabia's King Fahd dies.</title>
<headline>Sister of Saudi Arabia's King Fahd dies.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A sister of King Fahd of Saudi Arabia died on Monday at the age of 82, the state-run Saudi news agency (SPA) said, quoting a royal court statement.</p>
<p>A source close to the Saudi royal family said princess Sheikha, in fact a half-sister of the monarch, had died after a long illness.</p>
<p>The SPA report said &quot;Her royal highness Princess Sheikha bint Abdul-Aziz bin Abdul-Rahman al-Saud&quot; would be laid to rest on Tuesday after prayers at the main Imam Turki mosque in the Saudi capital Riyadh.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
